### Brief {index}

The runtime serves append-only chat and treats the latest committed assistant boundary as the primary reuse point.

`shared_root` caches the common system instruction when it is hot. `committed_head` restores KV and Mamba state together. `bytes_not_entries` means the cache is sized and evicted by bytes. Measured artifacts should drive policy changes.

